window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Writing together for the first time, <i>New York Times</i> best-selling authors Lynsay Sands and Hannah Howell present the darkly passionate story of two men sworn to conquer the hunger that pounds in their blood - and the women who may be their only salvation....</p> <p>Note: This novella is also included in <i>The Eternal Highlander </i>anthology by Lynsay Sands and Hannah Howell.</p> <p><b>Contains mature themes.</b></p>"; 
